{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Four Directions&quot; is a turn-based strategy game that builds upon hardcore tactical combat with a unique twist: a rotatable Rubik's Cube-style battlefield. This dynamic terrain system keeps the battlefield evolving, while cleverly integrated mechanisms and card skills deepen the strategy and enhance level design.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776750/extras/5c97a97981d32f24273b16dde543a0cd.avif?t=1764345564\" width=1560 height=184 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rotatable cube elevates the battlefield from 2D to 3D, creating ever-changing tactical opportunities. Master its rotations to turn the tide in extreme situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With up to a 10x10 grid, the game preserves the grand-scale, iron tide warfare of classic tactical games across complex terrain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776750/extras/4764c51e27c1fed6a68e4409ff5ede47.avif?t=1764345564\" width=1560 height=209 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command 15 unique heroes\u2014like Swordsmen, Axemen, Spearmen, and Archers\u2014each with weapon-triangle advantages to break through enemy lines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple team compositions and progression paths allow you to train and reclassify your destined heroes, evoking the deep customization hardcore fans love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776750/extras/157ba93c100c8a46e6ef1fd4051171fd.avif?t=1764345564\" width=1560 height=202 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter features carefully designed mechanisms. Uncover their secrets, use them to ambush foes, and carve a path to victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember: healing mechanisms restore enemy HP but also grant you EXP\u2014making your growth unstoppable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776750/extras/66e27a8e9ef149cfd9acde551a7b99d6.avif?t=1764345564\" width=1560 height=174 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize various card skills, including stat boosts, cloning, invisibility, position swap, and teleportation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleport cards let your heroes strike from anywhere, eliminating key targets instantly. Deploy these skills wisely to reverse the battle\u2019s outcome.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3776750?t=1764345564","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3776750?t=1764345564","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776750/b88ecdff0f95afbd6c2738f520a846ba5e7e6b6e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764345564","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776750/b88ecdff0f95afbd6c2738f520a846ba5e7e6b6e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764345564","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Four Directions&quot; is a turn-based strategy game that builds upon hardcore tactical combat with a unique twist: a rotatable Rubik's Cube-style battlefield. This dynamic terrain system keeps the battlefield evolving, while cleverly integrated mechanisms and card skills deepen the strategy and enhance level design.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776750/extras/5c97a97981d32f24273b16dde543a0cd.avif?t=1764345564\" width=1560 height=184 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rotatable cube elevates the battlefield from 2D to 3D, creating ever-changing tactical opportunities. Master its rotations to turn the tide in extreme situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With up to a 10x10 grid, the game preserves the grand-scale, iron tide warfare of classic tactical games across complex terrain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776750/extras/4764c51e27c1fed6a68e4409ff5ede47.avif?t=1764345564\" width=1560 height=209 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command 15 unique heroes\u2014like Swordsmen, Axemen, Spearmen, and Archers\u2014each with weapon-triangle advantages to break through enemy lines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple team compositions and progression paths allow you to train and reclassify your destined heroes, evoking the deep customization hardcore fans love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776750/extras/157ba93c100c8a46e6ef1fd4051171fd.avif?t=1764345564\" width=1560 height=202 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter features carefully designed mechanisms. Uncover their secrets, use them to ambush foes, and carve a path to victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember: healing mechanisms restore enemy HP but also grant you EXP\u2014making your growth unstoppable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776750/extras/66e27a8e9ef149cfd9acde551a7b99d6.avif?t=1764345564\" width=1560 height=174 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize various card skills, including stat boosts, cloning, invisibility, position swap, and teleportation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleport cards let your heroes strike from anywhere, eliminating key targets instantly. Deploy these skills wisely to reverse the battle\u2019s outcome.</p></li></ul>","developers":["LHStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776750/1995e54a517539b9d4aad0ed8c0bd10a53fb4eec/header.jpg?t=1764345564","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 LHStudio . All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Four Directions","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (SP1+) and above<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x64 or x86<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["LHStudio"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Fantasy-Gewalt","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"1 Oct, 2026"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776750/b0f3563ab86b9a21f5a04a06a4dd9225f3111b7b/ss_b0f3563ab86b9a21f5a04a06a4dd9225f3111b7b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764345564","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776750